{"id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"Atomic Formula","display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["92-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1, t_2 \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(t_1, t_2 \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\)</span> (definition-target set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AtFml}_G \\coloneqq \\{(t_1=t_2)\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AtFml}_G \\coloneqq \\{(t_1=t_2)\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\)</span> : 原子公式集</li>\n<li>原子公式只有等式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1 = t_2\">\\(t_1 = t_2\\)</span></li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t_1=t_2)\">\\((t_1=t_2)\\)</span> 是全括号语法串；等号的语义由结构解释给出</li>\n<li>在系统G中，原子公式是最简单的公式</li>\n<li>所有复杂公式由原子公式和逻辑连接词构造</li>\n<li>这是语言的最底层</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t_1, t_2 \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G$ (terms, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t_1, t_2 \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AtFml}_G \\coloneqq \\{(t_1=t_2)\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"t_1 = t_2","display":false},{"tex":"(t_1=t_2)","display":false}],"bytes":863,"backlinks":[{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_G$ (atomic-formula set, see [[92-df-atomic-formula]])"},{"id":"6785ab5b9adf7eb7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_G$ (atomic-formula set, see [[92-df-atomic-formula]])"},{"id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_G$ (atomic-formula set, see [[92-df-atomic-formula]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-10","